WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.960
This industry briefing explains assurance
across the AI lifecycle: context,

00:00:05.024 --> 00:00:10.080
generated tests, independent evaluation,
action controls and release evidence.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:15.200
It includes testing AI applications as
well as using AI in quality engineering.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:20.400
If your immediate question is how AI
helps an existing banking QA team,

00:00:20.457 --> 00:00:22.960
follow the banking workflow
link on this slide.

00:00:23.024 --> 00:00:27.440
That engineering walkthrough traces one
payment requirement through unit tests,

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:31.120
API tests, fixtures, execution,

00:00:31.192 --> 00:00:34.080
diagnosis, repair and release evidence.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:38.400
The final slide here also
provides that nine-step overview.

00:00:38.446 --> 00:00:41.600
Choose the banking route
for concrete delivery handoffs,

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.640
and this industry route
for the wider assurance architecture.
